<!doctype html>
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"/>
<title>Post-Implementation Review: {{ solution_name }}</title>
<style>:root{color-scheme:light dark}
body{margin:0 auto;max-width:52rem;padding:2rem 1.25rem;
font:16px/1.6 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",Roboto,sans-serif;
color:#1b1b1b;background:#fff}
h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6{line-height:1.25;margin:2rem 0 .6rem}
h1{font-size:1.9rem} h2{font-size:1.45rem} h3{font-size:1.15rem}
p,ul,ol,blockquote,table,pre{margin:0 0 1rem}
code{font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;font-size:.9em;
background:#f2f2f2;padding:.1em .3em;border-radius:3px}
pre{background:#f6f6f6;padding:.9rem 1rem;border-radius:5px;overflow-x:auto}
pre code{background:none;padding:0}
blockquote{border-left:3px solid #d0d0d0;margin-left:0;padding-left:1rem;
color:#4a4a4a}
table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;display:block;overflow-x:auto}
th,td{border:1px solid #ddd;padding:.4rem .6rem;text-align:left}
th{background:#f6f6f6}
hr{border:0;border-top:1px solid #ddd;margin:2rem 0}
a{color:#0b57d0}
@media(prefers-color-scheme:dark){
body{color:#e6e6e6;background:#151515}
code{background:#242424} pre{background:#1d1d1d}
th{background:#1d1d1d} th,td{border-color:#333}
blockquote{border-left-color:#3a3a3a;color:#b0b0b0} a{color:#8ab4f8}}</style></head>
<body>
<h1>Post-Implementation Review: {{ solution_name }}</h1>
<p><strong>Go-Live Date:</strong> {{ date }} <strong>Review Date:</strong> {{ date }} <strong>Review Period:</strong> [X months post go-live] <strong>Reviewer:</strong> [Name — independent of delivery team]</p>
<h2>Business Outcomes</h2>
<h3>Original Business Case</h3>
<table><thead><tr><th>Benefit</th><th>Projected Value</th><th>Projected Timeframe</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>[Benefit]</td><td>[$X] or [X%]</td><td>{{ timeframe }}</td></tr></tbody></table>
<h3>Actual Results</h3>
<table><thead><tr><th>Benefit</th><th>Projected</th><th>Actual</th><th>Variance</th><th>Sample n</th><th>Status</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>[Benefit]</td><td>{{ value }}</td><td>{{ value }}</td><td>[+/-X%]</td><td>[n]</td><td>Achieved / Partial / Not Achieved</td></tr></tbody></table>
<h2>Adoption Metrics</h2>
<table><thead><tr><th>Metric</th><th>Target</th><th>Actual</th><th>Notes</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>User adoption rate</td><td>[X%]</td><td>[X%]</td><td>{{ user_adoption_rate }}</td></tr><tr><td>Feature usage rate</td><td>[X%]</td><td>[X%]</td><td>{{ core_features_used }}</td></tr><tr><td>Training completion</td><td>[X%]</td><td>[X%]</td><td>-</td></tr></tbody></table>
<h2>Issues Encountered</h2>
<table><thead><tr><th>Issue</th><th>Resolution</th><th>Time to Resolve</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>{{ issue }}</td><td>{{ how_resolved }}</td><td>{{ duration }}</td></tr></tbody></table>
<h2>Lessons Learned</h2>
<h3>What Worked Well</h3>
<ul><li>{{ item }}</li></ul>
<h3>What Could Be Improved</h3>
<ul><li>{{ item }}</li></ul>
<h2>Recommendations</h2>
<h3>Enhancement Opportunities</h3>
<ol><li>{{ opportunity }}</li></ol>
<h3>Process Improvements</h3>
<ol><li>{{ improvement }}</li></ol>
<h2>Conclusion</h2>
<p>[Overall assessment: did the solution deliver the projected value? What is the recommendation for the next phase or investment?]</p>
</body></html>
